# ── Generated data ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Convergence curves, coverage tables and run logs are all reproducible
# from the generators + run_convergence.sh.  Curated result files that
# are worth versioning are already tracked; git keeps tracking those, so
# these patterns only affect NEW files.  Use `git add -f` to add one.
*.csv
*.txt

# ── Generated vector sets and sweep logs ─────────────────────────────
vectors_*/
run_*_logs/
.conv_*/

# ── Murphi build products (rumur output + compiled verifiers) ────────
murphi*/*_fsm
murphi*/*_fsm_v[0-9]
murphi*/*.c
__pycache__/

# ── Coverage databases ───────────────────────────────────────────────
*.ucdb
